# =====================================================================
# Release V066 -- Catalog the 2 new Tier-1 metrics
# =====================================================================
# Adds to Config.Metric_Definitions (idempotent MERGE re-seed):
#   open_courses_without_appt_value  (treatment, currency, below, point_in_time)
#   immediate_forward_utilisation    (scheduling, percent,  above, point_in_time)
